  "title": "Engagement acceptance decisions",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Engagement acceptance decisions</h2><p>Classify the requested services and decide whether proposed acceptance terms are appropriate.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f1\">Appropriate service for Client A</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f1\"><option value=\"Audit\">Audit</option><option value=\"Compilation\">Compilation</option><option value=\"Preparation\">Preparation</option><option value=\"Agreed-upon procedures\">Agreed-upon procedures</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f2\">Appropriate service for Client B</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f2\"><option value=\"Review\">Review</option><option value=\"Compilation\">Compilation</option><option value=\"Preparation\">Preparation</option><option value=\"Agreed-upon procedures\">Agreed-upon procedures</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f3\">Appropriate service for Client C</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f3\"><option value=\"Agreed-upon procedures\">Agreed-upon procedures</option><option value=\"Audit\">Audit</option><option value=\"Review\">Review</option><option value=\"Compilation\">Compilation</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f4\">Best response to Client D’s restriction</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs3-f4\"><option value=\"Resolve the restriction before accepting\">Resolve the restriction before accepting</option><option value=\"Promise an unmodified opinion\">Promise an unmodified opinion</option><option value=\"Accept without documenting it\">Accept without documenting it</option><option value=\"Replace debt evidence with the fee agreement\">Replace debt evidence with the fee agreement</option></select></div></section>",
