    {
      "id": "aud-m1-tbs3-ex1",
      "title": "Service requests",
      "html": "<p>Client A wants an opinion with reasonable assurance on annual statements. Client B wants limited assurance on historical statements. Client C wants only findings from inventory-count procedures agreed by the parties. Client D will refuse all access to material debt agreements.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aud-m1-tbs3-ex2",
      "title": "Acceptance criteria",
      "html": "<p>Assume no law requires accepting Client D. Management must acknowledge its financial-reporting responsibility and provide information and access necessary for the engagement.</p>"
    }
