  "explanation": "<h3>Appropriate service for Client A</h3><p>An audit provides reasonable assurance and an opinion.</p><h3>Appropriate service for Client B</h3><p>A review provides limited assurance on historical statements.</p><h3>Appropriate service for Client C</h3><p>The practitioner reports the specified procedures and findings.</p><h3>Best response to Client D’s restriction</h3><p>A material pre-acceptance scope restriction undermines the engagement preconditions.</p>"
